{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/108286","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/108286/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/108286/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/108286/events","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/108286","id":3203222948,"node_id":"I_kwDOAO6SJc6-7U2k","number":108286,"title":"ViewportTexture shader parameter breaks after project reload","user":{"login":"lupuchard","id":2514990,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI1MTQ5OTA=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2514990?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/lupuchard","html_url":"https://github.com/lupuchard","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lupuchard/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lupuchard/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lupuchard/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lupuchard/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lupuchard/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lupuchard/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lupuchard/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lupuchard/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lupuchard/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":73330064,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2NA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/bug","name":"bug","color":"ff6055","default":true,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279128044,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkxMjgwNDQ=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/confirmed","name":"confirmed","color":"aaddaa","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":1609442062,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwxNjA5NDQyMDYy","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:shaders","name":"topic:shaders","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":6,"created_at":"2025-07-04T16:13:56Z","updated_at":"2025-07-06T02:00:33Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\n- Reproducible in v4.3.stable, v4.4.1.stable and v4.5.beta2\n\n### System information\n\nGodot v4.5.beta2 - Linux Mint 22.1 (Xia) on X11 - X11 display driver, Multi-window, 2 monitors - Vulkan (Forward+) - dedicated AMD Radeon RX 6800 XT (RADV NAVI21) - AMD Ryzen 5 3600 6-Core Processor (12 threads) - 31.28 GiB memory\n\n### Issue description\n\nUsing a ViewportTexture as a shader parameter works until you reload the project, at which point it seems to be replaced with the broken purple pattern texture.\n\nWorking as intended:\n<img width=\"755\" height=\"378\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/6545cae3-d96f-4767-bc19-43c06281dcab\" />\n<img width=\"343\" height=\"193\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/3b006bb2-12a6-47b2-95c0-30f83ed7c363\" />\n\nAfter reload:\n<img width=\"744\" height=\"390\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/ba8840a6-b4a1-46c1-a4d7-bce68f24bd52\" />\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n1. Create a SubViewport and put a Camera3D inside.\n2. Create a quad MeshInstance3D and give it a new shader material with \"Local to Scene\" checked.\n3. Add a shader script:\n```\nshader_type spatial;\nuniform sampler2D ScreenTexture;\nvoid vertex() { }\nvoid fragment() {\n\tALBEDO = texture(ScreenTexture, UV).rgb;\n}\n```\n4. Set the Screen Texture shader parameter to a ViewportTexture, choose the SubViewport.\n5. Reload the project.\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n[viewporttexturetest.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/21061379/viewporttexturetest.zip)\nTo reproduce you'll first need to clear and replace the shader's texture parameter with a new ViewportTexture.","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/108286/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/108286/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null}